    <string name="description">This app demonstrates a list rendered entirely on a separate RenderThread, keeping the UI Thread free from rendering work.\n\nKey Features:\n• SurfaceView provides separate rendering surface\n• Dedicated render thread handles all drawing\n• UI Thread only processes touch events\n• Simulates WeChat Moments-style list\n\nThis app provides 11 different load levels including Long Frame Load for performance testing.</string>
    
